th form college at this time and later on want to study medicine at university.', 'special_interests' => 'In terms of accomplishments I have completed a maths masterclass university course when I was in Year 9 and also achieved a certificate for the UK maths challenge as well. I have also gotten player of the year in both football and cricket where now Iâ€™m hoping to achieve something in weightlifting as well.', 'special_skills' => 'My special skills are that I can play the violin and also I am athletic. By going on the trip I want to make more and new special skills.', 'contrib_entertainment' => 'I can play violin.', 'reason_for_camp' => 'Because I had attended the Rotary youth leadership award in the Brecon Beacons and loved the experience. I learnt about skills to be a leader and talked with all new people there. The reason I want to go on the youth camp programme is because I want to further improve my skills of doing new activities, meeting different people of different cultures and most importantly the chance to talk to  amazing new people.', 'personal_remarks' => '', 'place_of_birth' => 'Newport, Gwent, United Kingdom', 'em_name' => 'Farah Khan', 'em_relationship' => 'Aunt', 'em_htel' => '+44 7955 725805', 'em_mobile' => '+44 7955 725805', 'em_email' => 'Kfarah57@yahoo.com', 'country_citizenship' => null, 'image_location' => 'uploads/pict_app3731.png', 'date_of_app' => '2019-09-06 21:25:00'],
