ll be working the ski season in Banff, Canada from December 2019 - May 2020. I hope to improve my skiing during my free time.', 'attainment_vocation' => 'I achieved 11 GCSEs and A-level maths, biology and chemistry, as well as Welsh Baccalaureate Advanced. I have an unconditional offer to study Cyber Security at the University of Portsmouth in the UK. I have deferred entry until September 2020. I am currently working at the Campanile Hotel in Cardiff as a General Assistant, before travelling to Banff.

I took part in the Engineering Education Scheme Wales project with the company GE Aviation. Our team received the award for Best Engineering Design from Ford in April 2018. In July 2018, I attended a residential course in Life Sciences at Warwick University in the UK.', 'special_interests' => 'I have achieved the Duke of Edinburgh Bronze, Silver Awards and Gold Awards. In August 2018, I successfully completed the RYLA (Rotary Youth Leadership Award). In July 2019, I took part in the Rotary Youth Exchange International Canoe Camp, in Sioux Lookout, Canada.

I am a member of the ALPHA (Advice Leading to Public Health Advancement) research advisory group. This consists of young people aged 14 - 25 who advise researchers by discussing their views on public health topics.', 'special_skills' => 'I have experience of canoeing, hill walking, orienteering, gorge walking, caving and first aid. Through participation in the RYLA and Duke of Edinburgh Award, I have had the opportunity to improve my leadership and teamwork skills, and increase my self-confidence.', 'contrib_entertainment' => 'Possibly - I am learning to play the guitar.', 'reason_for_camp' => 'A Rotary Youth Exchange Camp/Tour offers an opportunity to experience another part of the world and spend time with young people from a range of countries. It will offer an insight into the lives of those from different cultures, provide the chance to make new friends and challenge myself.', 'personal_remarks' => 'I am enthusiastic, adaptable, motivated and keen to broaden my horizons.', 'place_of_birth' => 'Cardiff, South Glamorgan, UK', 'em_name' => 'Peter Fairbrother', 'em_relationship' => 'Grandfather', 'em_htel' => '01633867296', 'em_mobile' => '07789742954', 'em_email' => '', 'country_citizenship' => null, 'image_location' => 'uploads/pict_app3736.jpeg', 'date_of_app' => '2019-09-10 17:05:00'],
