am working on my grade 4. I enjoy athletics and I run 800m and 1500m. I have run for Peterborough in county cross country and at County/region level. I enjoy swimming and I have been scuba diving twice. In the winter, I sometimes ski with my family. I have a black belt in karate. I sometimes play chess for my enjoyment.', 'attainment_vocation' => 'In school, I have had the main part often in school plays and I have been on stage in other productions. In all subjects, I am assessed at a grade 7 or higher (A<). I usually represent the school in a variety of extra-curricular activities. including athletics and football. I have also taken part in a Maths Challenge. In year 8, I won a form prize for attainment.', 'special_interests' => 'I have a wide range of special interests and sporting activties; football in particular. While playing footbball at grassroots level, I have won many league titles with my team, and cup competitions. I did karate from age 10-14 and during that time achieved black belt. ', 'special_skills' => 'Yes- I have good leadership skills, often leading house assembly in school, and i have been Captain of my football team. I also currently captain the school cross country team. I have been recognized for my excellent maths skills, reprasenting the school in maths competitions.', 'contrib_entertainment' => 'Yes, I play the drums and I take part in drama productions, often having the lead part in recent years.', 'reason_for_camp' => 'I have chosen to participate in this programme because I believe I am now mature enough to engage in more indepependent activities and I would like to meet people from around the world. For me, it is essential that we appreciate each other\'s cultural differences and learn from each other so that the globe seems much smaller and connecetd.', 'personal_remarks' => 'I am looking forward to the Rotary camp placement and i am confident that it will be a rewarding experience for myself and hopefully the people I meet! ', 'place_of_birth' => 'Peterborough, Cambridgeshire, England', 'em_name' => 'Jane Buckle', 'em_relationship' => 'Aunt', 'em_htel' => '', 'em_mobile' => '+44 7530 416920', 'em_email' => 'jane.buckle196@gmail.com', 'country_citizenship' => null, 'image_location' => 'uploads/pict_app3782.png', 'date_of_app' => '2019-09-26 08:55:00'],
