            ['idapplication' => '904', 'emergency_contact' => false, 'parent_div_sep' => false, 'dob' => '2001-11-29', 'gender' => false, 'email_address' => 'meskauskas02@gmail.com', 'school' => null, 'why_rotary' => null, 'consider_alt_country' => null, 'how_did_you_hear' => 'Presentation at School/College/University', 'firstname' => 'Rytis', 'surname' => 'Meskauskas', 'address' => 'Belmount 19', 'city' => 'Dungannon', 'county' => 'Tyrone', 'postcode' => 'BT716BP', 'contact_no' => '+44 7871 931835', 'alt_contact_no' => '+44 7761 699259', 'parent_1' => 'Danguole Meskauskiene Sendriute', 'parent_2' => '', 'application_no' => '3801', 'citizen_of' => 'UK', 'other_info' => null, 'exchange_type' => 'CAMPS & TOURS', 'pref_name' => 'Rytis', 'parent_support' => false, 'dyeo_id' => '1160', 'realm' => 'USER', 'application_status' => 'Accepted', 'application_status_note' => 'NOR01 Norway - Explore Western Norway 2020', 'dyeo_assigned' => true, 'application_fee' => null, 'application_fee_paid' => false, 'parent1_rotarian' => false, 'parent2_rotarian' => false, 'parent1_rotary_club' => '', 'parent2_rotary_club' => '', 'parent1_email' => 'asbiedna@gmail.com', 'parent2_email' => '', 'parent1_tel' => '', 'parent2_tel' => '', 'parent1_mobile' => '+44 7761 699259', 'parent2_mobile' => '', 'parent1_btel' => '', 'parent2_btel' => '', 'parent1_occupation' => 'Child Minder', 'parent2_occupation' => '', 'religion' => 'Christianity', 'diet_restriction' => 'None', 'smoke' => false, 'smoke_why' => '', 'drink' => false, 'drink_why' => '', 'illegal_drugs' => false, 'illegal_drugs_why' => '', 'native_language' => 'Lithuanian', 'medical_condition' => false, 'treated_condition' => false, 'prescribed_meds' => false, 'special_req' => false, 'medical_info' => '', 'rotary_club_id' => '19721', 'free_activities' => 'On my free time I like to do multiple things, like go to the gym, sport clubs like MMA, Boxing or Airsoft. At home I would usually sit in my room read books, spent time on my computer, learn different skills on it like marketing or just entertainment stuff. Also, I film and edit different kinds footage as it would be games or realize videos (basically I create montages). Time to time I would  be social and spent time with my friends outside or go camping somewhere nice. Depending on the season and weather I would go hiking and travel new places.', 'attainment_vocation' => 'I currently attend St Patrick\'s Academy, Dungannon Studying A levels. Subjects I have chosen are Media studies, Business studies and Sport studies. If I would choose education path in the future then I would like to attend university like Queens in Belfast. Studying Broadcast Production which teaches all the elements in the filming industry behind and in front of the camera. When completing this I would try to get a job as a Presenter as it\'s a job I would like to peruse in the future. Either in radio or TV, also directing movies or working with cameras as I am right now.', 'special_interests' => 'My special interests is to find a way making to accomplish my dream which is very difficult. As in the future I would like to have good money in my bank account I research different ways to achieve this. For example right now I am investing in stock markets and trade using different tactics to increase my chance of winning. I have tried online buying and selling and market management. My accomplishments is the fact am able to change my faults into success as when every time something bad happens in life I can overcome it really quick. But speaking education vise I have became a student councilor, achieved 100% attendance...', 'special_skills' => 'I would think I do. As i love to develop different kind of skills. Basically learning something new. But I currently work as a Dispatch Supervisor this has improved my skills major. As I have became an even better leader, by decision making, working under stress, looking after others etc. I have used these skills when I did Duke of Edinburgh Gold Award hiking 4 days in the mountains, I was leading the team and looking after everyone, by helping them out giving advice and motivating them to keep going.', 'contrib_entertainment' => 'I don\'t play any instrument but i would consider fighting sport like MMA entertaining. As many people come to the events to watch this sport etc. So this is what i could do.', 'reason_for_camp' => 'I am not to sure. The reason I am here is to meet different kind of people as I find it really cool the idea of having a friend that I have seen eye to eye in another country. Still having contacts with them etc. I think this fascinates me. Also I have grow up beside a person that always like to travel which means I will like to travel to. Going different places and learning something new and useful is really beneficial. As I guess in like there isn\'t much time so may as well meet new people and have fun.', 'personal_remarks' => 'I think I have mentioned everything :).', 'place_of_birth' => 'Klaipeda, Lithuania', 'em_name' => 'Ruta Meskauskaite', 'em_relationship' => 'Sister', 'em_htel' => '', 'em_mobile' => '+44 7784 537207', 'em_email' => 'asbiedna@gmail.com', 'country_citizenship' => null, 'image_location' => 'uploads/pict_app3801.png', 'date_of_app' => '2019-10-07 15:30:00'],
