', 'contrib_entertainment' => 'I can play the piano and can contribute to the conversations with life experiences.', 'reason_for_camp' => 'I took part in the youth exchange programme last year and I had an incredible experience of meeting new people, getting more independence and having new experiences. Since I had such a great time away last year I wanted to take part again this year as I want to meet a whole new group of people and experience a different country in order to take part in fun activities while making new friends.', 'personal_remarks' => '', 'place_of_birth' => 'Craigavon, County Tyrone, Northern Ireland', 'em_name' => 'Ann Gilmore', 'em_relationship' => 'Grandmother', 'em_htel' => '02880758495', 'em_mobile' => 'None', 'em_email' => 'None', 'country_citizenship' => null, 'image_location' => 'uploads/pict_app3811.png', 'date_of_app' => '2019-10-14 16:12:00'],
