> 'I received 10 GCSEs grade 7-9 (A-A*) last summer, including maths and English, and I am currently studying for my A-levels on chemistry, geography and history at the King\'s school sixth form.', 'special_interests' => 'As i enjoy singing, I am part of my school\'s senior choir, and within this I have taken part in school concerts. I also competed in the national Bar Mock Trial competition this year in the role of Defence barrister. I have also taken part in several school productions, such as Les Miserables and Bugsy Malone.', 'special_skills' => 'Communication skills, work well in a team.', 'contrib_entertainment' => '', 'reason_for_camp' => 'I wanted to participate in this programme in order to further my independence and ability to do things on my own. I also would like to engage in new experiences and meet new people by travelling to somewhere different. For these reasons, I would be specifically interested in camps which are more based on the culture of the region, but would be open to travelling to anywhere.', 'personal_remarks' => '', 'place_of_birth' => 'Peterborough, Cambridgeshire, UK', 'em_name' => 'Jane Greene', 'em_relationship' => 'Aunt ', 'em_htel' => '+44 1733 380976', 'em_mobile' => '', 'em_email' => 'greenie15@sky.com', 'country_citizenship' => null, 'image_location' => 'uploads/pict_app3816.png', 'date_of_app' => '2019-10-19 14:51:00'],
            ['idapplication' => '917', 'emergency_contact' => false, 'parent_div_sep' => false, 'dob' => '2001-01-01', 'gender' => false, 'email_address' => 'j.siles@hotmail.co.uk', 'school' => null, 'why_rotary' => null, 'consider_alt_country' => null, 'how_did_you_hear' => 'Other', 'firstname' => 'Jonathan Matthew', 'surname' => 'Bacon', 'address' => '36 Castle Street', 'city' => 'Ongar', 'county' => 'Essex', 'postcode' => 'CM5 9JS', 'contact_no' => '+44 1992 610843', 'alt_contact_no' => '+44 7954 440298', 'parent_1' => '', 'parent_2' => '', 'application_no' => '3817', 'citizen_of' => 'Dual Citizenship - Bolivia, UK', 'other_info' => null, 'exchange_type' => 'CAMPS & TOURS', 'pref_name' => 'Jonathan', 'parent_support' => false, 'dyeo_id' => '1240', 'realm' => 'USER', 'application_status' => 'Accepted', 'application_status_note' => 'Paid Admin Fee, Placed SWI02', 'dyeo_assigned' => true, 'application_fee' => null, 'application_fee_paid' => false, 'parent1_rotarian' => false, 'parent2_rotarian' => false, 'parent1_rotary_club' => '', 'parent2_rotary_club' => '', 'parent1_email' => '', 'parent2_email' => '', 'parent1_tel' => '', 'parent2_tel' => '', 'parent1_mobile' => '', 'parent2_mobile' => '', 'parent1_btel' => '', 'parent2_btel' => '', 'parent1_occupation' => '', 'parent2_occupation' => '', 'religion' => 'None', 'diet_restriction' => 'None', 'smoke' => false, 'smoke_why' => '', 'drink' => false, 'drink_why' => '', 'illegal_drugs' => false, 'illegal_drugs_why' => '', 'native_language' => 'English and Spanish but English is a bit better', 'medical_condition' => false, 'treated_condition' => false, 'prescribed_meds' => false, 'special_req' => false, 'medical_info' => '', 'rotary_club_id' => '51418', 'free_activities' => 'Way... way too much PC gaming haha, really enjoy being active so running is cool, learning foreign languages, going to concerts because listening to music is a huge part of my life, memorising the world map for some reason xD and following geopolitics from time to time.', 'attainment_vocation' => 'Was a top set student throughout secondary school and got decent GCSEs highest grades were A* in Chemistry and 8 in Maths and at A-Levels I got a C in Chemistry and passes in Maths and Physics. My 2 favourite subjects are Chemistry and Geography so hopefully I can pursue one of them in the future', 'special_interests' => 'Completed the bronze DofE award and was a scout for a couple years, so took part in a handful of camping trips. More recently I got involved with the National Citizenship Service (NCS) which in the UK is a government funded 3 weeks away doing some outdoor activities and gaining skills while taking part in a social action project. Also played rugby union for ages like 8 years I was part of my local club and have some medals to show for it :D was great fun miss those days', 'special_skills' => 'Not many to pass on other than exchanging conversation in different languages.', 'contrib_entertainment' => 'Studied Piano up to Grade 5, so that and want to start playing the guitar just need to get one.', 'reason_for_camp' => 'Definitely do not want any programmes in any anglophone countries, other than that I\'m pretty open to where I go.', 'personal_remarks' => '', 'place_of_birth' => 'Cochabamba, Cochabamba, Bolivia', 'em_name' => 'Max Baldwin', 'em_relationship' => 'Friend', 'em_htel' => '', 'em_mobile' => '+44 7799 556787', 'em_email' => 'maxbaldwin80@gmail.com', 'country_citizenship' => null, 'image_location' => 'uploads/pict_app3817.jpeg', 'date_of_app' => '2019-10-19 21:27:00'],
            ['idapplication' => '918', 'emergency_contact' => false, 'parent_div_sep' => false, 'dob' => '2004-08-24', 'gender' => true, 'email_address' => 'Anna.catriona04@gmail.com', 'school' => null, 'why_rotary' => null, 'consider_alt_country' => false, 'how_did_you_hear' => 'Search engine', 'firstname' => 'Anna', 'surname' => 'Cannon', 'address' => '116 Ballinclea Heights', 'city' => 'Killiney', 'county' => 'Ireland', 'postcode' => 'A96 F3P3', 'contact_no' => ' +353 87 9704883', 'alt_contact_no' => '+353 87 7909661', 'parent_1' => 'Olena Cannon ', 'parent_2' => 'John Cannon', 'application_no' => '3818', 'citizen_of' => 'Republic of Ireland', 'other_info' => null, 'exchange_type' => 'CAMPS & TOURS', 'pref_name' => 'Anna', 'parent_support' => false, 'dyeo_id' => '1160', 'realm' => 'USER', 'application_status' => 'Accepted', 'application_status_note' => 'Paid Admin Fee', 'dyeo_assigned' => true, 'application_fee' => null, 'application_fee_paid' => false, 'parent1_rotarian' => false, 'parent2_rotarian' => false, 'parent1_rotary_club' => '', 'parent2_rotary_club' => '', 'parent1_email' => 'yelenacannon@gmail.com', 'parent2_email' => 'jdcannon02@gmail.com', 'parent1_tel' => '', 'parent2_tel' => '', 'parent1_mobile' => '+353 87 9704883', 'parent2_mobile' => '+353 87 2363777', 'parent1_btel' => '', 'parent2_btel' => '', 'parent1_occupation' => 'Self Employed ', 'parent2_occupation' => 'Engineer', 'religion' => 'Catholic', 'diet_restriction' => 'None', 'smoke' => false, 'smoke_why' => '', 'drink' => false, 'drink_why' => '', 'illegal_drugs' => false, 'illegal_drugs_why' => '', 'native_language' => 'English ', 'medical_condition' => null, 'treated_condition' => null, 'prescribed_meds' => null, 'special_req' => null, 'medical_info' => '', 'rotary_club_id' => '19693', 'free_activities' => 'I enjoy reading, baking for my family, hiking in scenic places , listening to music  and sports. Iâ€™m very athletic and swim with a club on a daily basis. I love spending most of my free  time with my close  friends or outdoors bringing my dog on walks. I love the ocean and especially adore surfing in our local beach.', 'attainment_vocation' => 'I am currently in third year of secondary school and this will be my first year taking State Exams. I value my education a lot. In both the two years prior to this  I have achieved an award of Academic Excellence for the highest academic grades in my year.', 'special_interests' => 'I have an interest in travelling and am eager to travel the world when I am older. Next year I have organised to travel to Germany as a foreign  exchange student for the school year. I am very lucky to have this opportunity and canâ€™t wait for the experience! My favourite subjects in school include History, German and English. I also have an interest in outdoors and nature.', 'special_skills' => 'I am an accomplished competitive swimmer. Last summer I represented my city (Dublin) at the  All Ireland Community Games in the relay. Our team placed 2nd out of all Ireland. I have also trained in Irish dancing since I was very young for almost nine years. I have danced at many shows,weddings and competitions where I have won lots of trophies and medals. However I recently stopped my training as unfortunately I couldnâ€™t balance this with school and swimming.', 'contrib_entertainment' => 'I am still  capable of performing an Irish Dance to represent my countryâ€™s culture and traditions. I like introducing people to Irish dancing who have never heard of it before and showing them what I can do.  Itâ€™s  really unique and usually interests others especially from different countries.', 'reason_for_camp' => 'Sicily has always been a place that I would love to to visit some day, Iâ€™m interested to learn about heritage and historical cultures of Sicily.
