            ['idapplication' => '932', 'emergency_contact' => false, 'parent_div_sep' => false, 'dob' => '2001-06-19', 'gender' => true, 'email_address' => 'juliaa.szczesnaa@icloud.com', 'school' => null, 'why_rotary' => null, 'consider_alt_country' => false, 'how_did_you_hear' => 'Presentation at School/College/University', 'firstname' => 'Julia', 'surname' => 'Szczesna', 'address' => '11 Rushdene Crescent', 'city' => 'London', 'county' => 'Middlesex', 'postcode' => 'UB56NE', 'contact_no' => '', 'alt_contact_no' => '+44 7749 379308', 'parent_1' => 'Ewelina Szczesna', 'parent_2' => '', 'application_no' => '3832', 'citizen_of' => 'UK', 'other_info' => null, 'exchange_type' => 'CAMPS & TOURS', 'pref_name' => 'Julia', 'parent_support' => false, 'dyeo_id' => '1130', 'realm' => 'USER', 'application_status' => 'Placed', 'application_status_note' => 'BEL01 Belgium - Flanders Camp 2020', 'dyeo_assigned' => true, 'application_fee' => null, 'application_fee_paid' => false, 'parent1_rotarian' => false, 'parent2_rotarian' => false, 'parent1_rotary_club' => '', 'parent2_rotary_club' => '', 'parent1_email' => 'ewelina.szczesna@icloud.com', 'parent2_email' => '', 'parent1_tel' => '', 'parent2_tel' => '', 'parent1_mobile' => '+44 7928 091820', 'parent2_mobile' => '', 'parent1_btel' => '', 'parent2_btel' => '', 'parent1_occupation' => 'Bus Driver', 'parent2_occupation' => '', 'religion' => 'Roman Catholic', 'diet_restriction' => 'None', 'smoke' => false, 'smoke_why' => '', 'drink' => false, 'drink_why' => '', 'illegal_drugs' => false, 'illegal_drugs_why' => '', 'native_language' => 'Polish', 'medical_condition' => false, 'treated_condition' => false, 'prescribed_meds' => false, 'special_req' => false, 'medical_info' => '', 'rotary_club_id' => '19536', 'free_activities' => 'I spend most of my free time going out with my friends to shopping malls as well as to new interesting places, not only to take pretty pictures but also to try out new restaurants with foods from all over the world. Moreover, I like to go for a walk or a jog in the mark with my dog to get some fresh air, and of course take pictures of the nature. If I\'m at home I love to music or movies as well as spend time with my family. Another thing I do in my free time is write notes and study to keep up with my lectures as well as work twice a week in Starbucks as a barista. ', 'attainment_vocation' => 'I am a first year student of Oxford Brookes University and I study Urban Design Planning and Development. I really enjoy this subject because it allows me to have a flexible career in the future and pick whether I would want to work in the creative art and design sector or in the planning and policies sector. ', 'special_interests' => 'I find the subject which I study very interesting as I am fascinated by the fact that we can plan a concept that influences a person\'s way of life; the place where they live, work and learn. One of my greatest accomplishments was having a months\' internship at GLA where I was given the opportunity to work on the UK\'s largest regeneration project managed by the OPDC department. Furthermore, I love trying out new things; I have took part in the Army Cadets, Volunteering, NCS and work experiences with Architects, Project Managers & Quantity Surveyors. ', 'special_skills' => 'Unfortunately, I do not have an amazing talent, however I do enjoy designing modern buildings and using creative softwares such as Google SketchUp as well as designing new products. Last year I designed and made a desk for architects which had an adjustable feature of changing the height and the angle. In addition, taking part in the activities mentioned above I have gained and developed my skill of teamwork, leadership, communication, responsibility, time management and commitment.
', 'contrib_entertainment' => 'Although I used to play the keyboard and the guitar, unfortunately I have stopped. However, I am able to contribute to entertainment not only because I am a very friendly person and a funny person, according to my family and friends, but also because I am very opened and I can easily talk with new people that I meet. I also make sure that the situation I am in is never awkward and that everyone is happy and feels included. I also know a lot of fun and entertaining card games which I have learnt on the previous summer camps as well as campfire songs.', 'reason_for_camp' => 'During the exchange I hope to learn more about the tradition and the culture of the country I will go to, meet long life friends which I will keep in contact with and visit new and interesting places. After my return, I would love to come back with beautiful pictures and memories as well as become even more independent. I loved all the summer camps I have already been on with RYE as they make my summer the best and give me and unforgettable experience and I am hoping for this camp to bring me the same, if not better. I cannot wait!', 'personal_remarks' => 'I am a polite, friendly and caring person. I am not shy of meeting and talking with new people who I don\'t know as I am opened. I love to travel and my aim is to travel to as many countries as I can, including the US and Asia.', 'place_of_birth' => 'Stargard Szczecinski, Poland', 'em_name' => 'Anna Kuczynska', 'em_relationship' => 'Family Friendriend', 'em_htel' => '', 'em_mobile' => '+44 75945 19935', 'em_email' => 'kucza003.313@gmail.com', 'country_citizenship' => null, 'image_location' => 'uploads/pict_app3832.jpeg', 'date_of_app' => '2019-11-07 14:08:00'],
