My 2018 GCSE results: Grade 8 Biology and Art. Grade 7 Maths, French, Physics, Chemistry and RS. Grade 6 English Lang, Geography and Graphics. Grade 4 English Lit.', 'special_interests' => 'I make sure that I am up to date with current affairs to do with media, music, and fashion. I\'m especially interested in visual communication and storytelling in cartoons and film and that\'s why I\'m applying to do a Foundation Year in Art and Design at Kingston University, UAL at King\'s Cross and UCA in Epsom.
