 my Mini Company group, as we had designed a book to help families maintain effective communication within the home.', 'special_interests' => 'I was the Deputy Secretary-General at the Davis College Model United Nations (DCMUN) conference 2020. This conference aims to encourage students to use their voice to stand up for what they believe in and also debate topical issues. I was awarded Best Delegate at the Davis College Model United Nations conference 2019. I had the opportunity to travel as a Youth Helper on the Annual Cloyne Diocese Pilgrimage to Lourdes 2019.', 'special_skills' => 'I have a passion for public speaking and enjoy representing my views to others. I also enjoy communicating, planning and organising as I have learnt how to effectively use these skills throughout my DCMUN journey.', 'contrib_entertainment' => 'I enjoy singing.', 'reason_for_camp' => 'The reason for my programme participation is because I believe that I will benefit from the friendships and experiences created throughout the duration of the camp. I also want to become more involved in Rotary.', 'personal_remarks' => '', 'place_of_birth' => 'Dublin, Republic of Ireland', 'em_name' => 'Christine Manuel', 'em_relationship' => 'Aunt', 'em_htel' => '', 'em_mobile' => '+353 86 3615708', 'em_email' => 'phirychristine@yahoo.com', 'country_citizenship' => null, 'image_location' => 'uploads/pict_app3857.png', 'date_of_app' => '2019-11-24 22:26:00'],
