o go on walks and have fun with my friends and help with youth teams.', 'attainment_vocation' => 'I go to St Jospephâ€™s Grammar School in Donaghmore, I am currently studying A-Levels and achieved 8 A*â€™s and 2As at GCSE.', 'special_interests' => 'I am interested in nature and boating. I have accomplished a positive relationship with my peers and teachers in school, I have a part-time job and have done constructive work experience in different job fields.', 'special_skills' => 'I am good at talking to different types of people and have good team-building skills. ', 'contrib_entertainment' => 'I am a good story teller and also like to sing and dance. I played the tin whistle when I was younger. ', 'reason_for_camp' => 'I am interested in this because I heard how enjoyable it was for people in the year above me at my school and would like to travel around the world as much as possible and meet new people. I would like to choose a camp in a sunny place with outdoor activities.', 'personal_remarks' => 'I would see myself as a friendly person who enjoys being around other people, I also enjoy a new environment.', 'place_of_birth' => 'Craigavon, Co. Armagh, Northern Ireland', 'em_name' => 'Eugene Quinn', 'em_relationship' => 'Grandfather', 'em_htel' => '+44 28 8773 8765', 'em_mobile' => '+44 7990 555445', 'em_email' => '', 'country_citizenship' => null, 'image_location' => 'uploads/pict_app3887.png', 'date_of_app' => '2019-12-14 20:17:00'],
