 cultures and backgrounds which I enjoyed a lot. Also, I like to take part in dancing which is also a part of the youth club and one of my favorite hobbies as being part of this dance group has taught me different ways to push myself to learn new skills and I have many opportunities to be able to connect with others from different countries and make a new friends. Despite that, I also like to help around the house by prepare dinner and cleaning the house. ', 'attainment_vocation' => 'I\'m highly proud of myself of what I have achieved during my time at St Patrick\'s College which I have achieved student of the month award and merits during my KS3 and I have achieved a top student for graphic products and P.E for girls. I have also achieved the Duke of Edinburgh Bronze Award, senior prefect for year 11 and qualification level 2 (Drama). Outside of school, I have completed Millennium Volunteers (Bronze, Silver, Gold) and I have also completed OCR/Level 2 sports and diversity qualification. ', 'special_interests' => ' My key interests include working with others and learning by doing and sharing talents amongst one another. I have accomplished a wide range of team working obstacles throughout my cobtribution to the communitys extra curricular activities from dancing to mentoring and building confidence through motivation.', 'special_skills' => 'My special skills are leadership, teamwork and communication in which I class as My top three skills. Throughout my experiences within different setting I have immensely enhanced upon these skills which enables me to have the capacity of inspiring others to have the confidence to come out of their comfort zones and learn the importance of effective interpersonal skills.', 'contrib_entertainment' => 'I have a very musical background and enjoy music of all backrounds I am keen in learning new musical instruments such as the guitar however, through years of experience in dance I have a very effective performing skills as well as the ability of choreographing.I am very enthusiastic in sharing with others my musical talents and am very keen to learn from others musical background.', 'reason_for_camp' => 'I have always wanted to get an experience abroad and gain knowledge of what is like as well as getting out of my comfort zone in which to be able to take on new challenges and valuable life lessons and I have also loved to meet new people from different cultures backgrounds as it can be very rewarding, because I  can broaden my ideas and ways of thinking. I  can learn new skills and gain new knowledge and being able to develop such a strong relationship with them. ', 'personal_remarks' => '', 'place_of_birth' => 'Timor-Leste , Dili Bemori', 'em_name' => 'Esperanca  Gusmao ', 'em_relationship' => 'Cousin', 'em_htel' => '', 'em_mobile' => 'â€­+44 7526 781285â€¬', 'em_email' => 'N/A', 'country_citizenship' => null, 'image_location' => 'uploads/pict_app3911.png', 'date_of_app' => '2019-12-27 16:43:00'],
